<title>GREECE: Cyprus bourse on roadshow in Athens May 9.</title>
<headline>Cyprus bourse on roadshow in Athens May 9.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus stock exchange will stage a publicity event May 9 in Athens to present the market's prospects to Greek institutional investors, brokers and Greek listed company executives, it said.</p>
<p>Greece's national economy minister, Yannos Papandoniou, and Cyprus' finance minister, Christodoulos Christodoulou, will speak during the event as both countries seek to further develop their equities markets, it said.</p>
<p>The issue of cross-listings of both Greek and Cypriot companies on both exchanges will also be discussed.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
